Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.71,0:00:03.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.61,0:00:05.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.52,0:00:11.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然平常有点好色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.79,0:00:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是其实背负着破除风穴诅咒的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:15.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而一直以来都在追杀奈落的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.06,0:00:19.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是感觉到和那个人一样的寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:21.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:23.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:24.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:32.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:36.74,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:40.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.15,0:00:44.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:48.75,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:57.50,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:02.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:06.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:10.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:14.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:18.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:22.72,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.09,0:01:26.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:33.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.11,0:01:38.80,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:46.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.43,0:02:30.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.33,0:02:33.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概在大雪中迷路了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.33,0:02:35.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:42.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没事了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.97,0:02:44.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫做小雪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.55,0:02:51.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸他发生什么事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.95,0:02:53.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸他…已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没有可以收容我的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.29,0:03:00.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没地方去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:03.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就到我家来住吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.23,0:03:08.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小雪的肌肤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:10.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像雪一样洁白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.47,0:03:11.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个好美丽的姑娘呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.07,0:03:13.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:17.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你干嘛突然打我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是在帮你打蚊子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:22.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.35,0:03:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我之后得修行嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:27.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以就没什么其它特别的事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:30.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你跟那个女的后来怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:32.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟她没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:35.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一转眼就过了七年了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:38.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时我还是个乳臭未干的小朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:41.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:46.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 打中了吧 哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:53.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第101话 七年之后 一场令人怀念的大雪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:03:59.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:02.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你振作点啊 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快睁开眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可千万不能死啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要坚强一点哪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:08.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个季节怎么会有雪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:09.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像醒过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:18.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:20.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出了什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:22.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以的话 能够告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:24.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是法师啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.04,0:04:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近附近经常有雪怪出现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村里已经有好几个壮丁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.81,0:04:31.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像他这样子突然之间…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:34.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你立刻赶去约定会面的小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:35.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这件事告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:36.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:38.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了阻止妖怪再出来害人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:39.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得先去收拾她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 这妖气不是太重
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:42.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位法师看起来这么年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:49.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会出事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:51.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过说起来这个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:55.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是个皮肤雪白的绝色美女呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.01,0:04:59.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几乎每个男人看到她就迷得晕头转向
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:01.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上跟着她走了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.15,0:05:09.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子这里恐怕也查不到奈落的线索了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:13.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:16.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚整理背包时 从里面翻出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来想要带来可以跟大家一起玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:21.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果没想到居然给忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:24.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得是不是受潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.87,0:05:26.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得先来试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:30.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜哇 这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫做烟火哦！烟火
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:34.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唔喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.45,0:05:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:41.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这种时候下雪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:43.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.91,0:06:08.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 弥勒法师…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:09.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.15,0:06:11.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.49,0:06:20.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位旅者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:24.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是在大雪中遇到麻烦了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:27.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问有什么我可以帮忙的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 这位姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你可不可以帮我生个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:37.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你忘啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.44,0:06:40.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子已经生下了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.45,0:06:46.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请去抱抱他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:48.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去抱抱我们的宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:51.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.02,0:06:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:07.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:09.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们两个一起吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:12.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正所谓无功者饭菜不留嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.08,0:07:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那几个坏蛋不必留给他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜哇 看起来真好吃耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是闻到香味才跑回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:23.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别胡说了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:24.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是因为突然下雪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.06,0:07:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 怪不得觉得这么冷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚跟弥勒法师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:31.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 他们还没回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:32.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过不了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:33.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚子饿了自然就会回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.67,0:07:36.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我跟云母的鱼耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:38.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别说那么小器的话嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:41.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇快过来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.57,0:07:42.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.01,0:07:44.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 珊瑚 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:07:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有经过你们的同意就自己进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不要紧啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:03.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且外面的雪下得那么大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们来吃点野猪肉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:06.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有很多喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.03,0:08:08.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 这真的很好吃耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:09.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还是生的耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:11.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫报应
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:15.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看 在雪女还没离开之前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:17.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们最好还是先待在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雪女？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:20.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:23.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种天气只要有个年轻的男人在路上走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.85,0:08:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会被一个年轻的姑娘叫住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.78,0:08:28.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷迷糊糊的跟着姑娘走之后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:32.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二天就往往会被人发现已经冻死在雪地里了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:37.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说这个小姑娘一身肌肤像雪一样白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:39.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个样子美若天仙的女人哩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:41.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都说宁可被冻死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也要想办法见她一面呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:45.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:48.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下弥勒法师危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:49.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.37,0:08:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚也跟他在一起不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:54.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 那大概不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:56.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真的一点都不了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:09:00.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看弥勒法师绝对不会放过那个姑娘的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候要是珊瑚突然出现的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.65,0:09:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种情景真不敢想象
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:06.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:08.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还用问吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:10.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候珊瑚一定会宰了弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:10.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样的话以前不知道说过多少次了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:14.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是不开窍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.27,0:09:18.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:22.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个雪女也是在奈落下落不明的时候才现身
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.27,0:09:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再怎么说她都是只妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:26.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就绝对不能够放着不管
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.91,0:09:27.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出去看看马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.41,0:09:29.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 我跟你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:30.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:33.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个你们拿去带在身上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:36.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是回魂汤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:39.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:41.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:48.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:54.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊 大家快来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.44,0:09:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.07,0:09:59.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 喝这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:00.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是回魂汤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:05.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得身体冰冷的时候 听说喝这个最有效了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.45,0:10:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这好像有效哎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说这是酒精浓度特别高的烧酒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:16.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上蝮蛇、蝾螈还有毛毛虫浸泡而成的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 她好像恢复精神了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:24.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.34,0:10:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你忘啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.51,0:10:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子已经生下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请去抱抱他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.38,0:10:35.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去抱抱我们的宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:41.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一家三口一定正开心的享受天伦之乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:43.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:52.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:11:01.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 一起进去吧 相公
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:06.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个女人并不是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:07.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:10.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么要出来到处害人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:12.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这样抓男人回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.15,0:11:15.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道就是为了要吸收男人身上的精气吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:20.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜哇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:21.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:22.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.29,0:11:24.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:26.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这些是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相公 就是这些孩子啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.67,0:11:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先进去熬点米汤给孩子们喝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:36.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.31,0:11:38.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜哇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:40.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尿布就在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:42.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.68,0:11:46.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:47.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:50.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:54.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经忘得一干二净了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:11:58.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们全都是我帮你生的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.43,0:12:01.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都…都是我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还这么多？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:08.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我亲耳听见的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说是法师亲生的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.94,0:12:13.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 这小子也到了该纳税的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.61,0:12:16.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能这么定下来也是件好事不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:20.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:23.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪随便说几句你们别全当真嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.23,0:12:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖气是从里面传出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:33.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:35.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上破了这个结界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.11,0:12:42.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:49.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好…乖乖啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好…乖乖啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊！别把鼻涕擤在我的衣服上啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊！我的锡杖不是你们的玩具啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:12:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.89,0:13:00.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.99,0:13:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我喂与作喝点米汤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.39,0:13:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有舍松的尿布湿了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.63,0:13:06.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有待会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还要唱歌给小虎听
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:09.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哄他乖乖睡觉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.13,0:13:10.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 马上去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 乖乖啦 别再哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:15.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 好不好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:18.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 马上帮你换尿布哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.64,0:13:20.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小宝宝快睡哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:22.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以在那边尿尿啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.91,0:13:24.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厕所在这边嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:30.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:33.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你一个人照顾他们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.53,0:13:38.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身为母亲 谁不会亲自照顾孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:39.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多孩子 难道全都是我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:45.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些孩子的家都被战火烧毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:50.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一个一生下来就不得不离开他们的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:53.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我经常捡这些孩子回来照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,久而久之就变成了这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:57.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是…辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:02.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们几个全都是可怜的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.93,0:14:11.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心一点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:12.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这好像是… 弥勒法师的歌声喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么不负责任的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.07,0:14:21.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道他也懂得疼自己的孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.94,0:14:25.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:27.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:30.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有间大屋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.11,0:14:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.08,0:14:35.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡得好熟喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:39.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖…乖…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.63,0:14:45.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是乖宝宝喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:47.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要赶快健康长大哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:53.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 好乖 好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好乖 好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.11,0:14:57.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.37,0:15:00.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子弥勒法师中了幻术了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:04.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快醒醒吧 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:06.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖…乖…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:12.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面几位来者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.26,0:15:19.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不准通行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:28.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.04,0:15:31.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧 雪豹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.65,0:15:42.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要勉强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:44.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天气这么冷 四肢当然不容易伸展
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.16,0:15:47.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我打倒他们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:49.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后把四魂之玉碎片抢过来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死妖怪 今天让我来收拾你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:00.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.57,0:16:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到这家伙这么不堪一击
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:04.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:05.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:06.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.44,0:16:08.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呀啊 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:13.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.08,0:16:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖哦 乖乖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:30.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面好像有点吵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:34.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是出了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群野狗在雪地迷了路了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都不必担心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:43.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上派人把它们赶走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:44.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:50.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝们…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:55.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:57.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:16:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快醒醒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来就很清醒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己仔细看看 这也叫清醒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…这些是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.19,0:17:12.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天休想逃离这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.02,0:17:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你长得和那个人那么像
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.56,0:17:16.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我所认识的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:20.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以其实我也不想对你这么的粗鲁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.20,0:17:29.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咿呀 怎么这么不顺利啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.47,0:17:32.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:35.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好快哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.31,0:17:35.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.81,0:17:39.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.49,0:17:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然让它闪开了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:51.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恨…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:53.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可恨了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明心地那么的善良
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:57.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么偏偏要诱捕那些男人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.07,0:17:59.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且加害他们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:01.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恨…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.07,0:18:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界太可恨了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:09.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恨我自己活在这个世上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.35,0:18:11.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恨啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.35,0:18:17.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下屠刀才能够立地成佛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:20.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得罪了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:30.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.24,0:18:36.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙怎么突然变成这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要用热
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:39.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们最怕热气跟火了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.01,0:18:41.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那就看我的狐火
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.75,0:18:44.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:53.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不管用嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.12,0:18:55.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:18:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以利用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:18:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:00.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我陪你过两招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:11.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.32,0:19:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:49.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是另一只雪怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.61,0:19:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.35,0:19:54.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信刚刚那个雪怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.69,0:19:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没有附身在这个灵魂上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:21.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个灵魂属于一个被卷入战争
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:24.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且丢了性命的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 她一直在寻找那些
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:32.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因不幸而离开人世的那些小孩的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.49,0:20:33.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至一直照顾着他们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:36.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信这个女人的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.09,0:20:38.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被雪怪给控制住了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.06,0:20:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是哀伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想战国时代的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:45.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该活得很艰辛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.67,0:20:46.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话又说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:48.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始当她告诉你替你生了孩子的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.17,0:20:50.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么想都不想就相信了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:53.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是有做过什么见不得人的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:55.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.98,0:20:57.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是个傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.91,0:20:58.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.85,0:21:03.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师是为了帮助可怜的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.29,0:21:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会故意假装中计吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:05.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.69,0:21:13.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身为法师怎么可能会犯下这种错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:14.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是一只蚊子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.67,0:21:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:22.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该继续上路了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:24.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.51,0:21:29.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那位姑娘真的好像喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:30.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:31.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:36.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那天帮助年纪还小的我的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:21:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位小雪姑娘…一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:43.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在世界的某个角落
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过着幸福快乐的日子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.64,0:22:00.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是残雪…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.55,0:22:15.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.73,0:22:24.79,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.07,0:22:34.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.58,0:22:44.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.79,0:22:48.95,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.29,0:22:53.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.10,0:23:01.26,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.31,0:23:07.57,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.98,0:23:12.24,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.55,0:23:19.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.99,0:23:29.26,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.67,0:23:52.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落消失之后 首次发现行踪的地方是北方山脉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.98,0:23:55.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盘踞那块地方的妖狼族突然被人袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.61,0:23:58.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,袭击他们的是拥有四魂之玉碎片的恶鬼「凶骨」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.68,0:23:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.45,0:24:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道从坟墓里复活了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.38,0:24:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便把你身上的四魂之玉碎片交出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.12,0:24:06.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们既不是人类也不是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.46,0:24:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些复苏的亡灵到底有何目的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.23,0:24:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被亡魂袭击的妖狼族
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.46,0:24:15.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别神气
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.46,0:24:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先让我帮兄弟们报仇再说
